paragraph:
The server reads `GITHUB_TOKEN`, `MAPLE_GITHUB_OWNER` and `MAPLE_GITHUB_REPO`
from the environment Claude Code starts in. The Stop hook is not bundled yet;
the `setup-maple-agent-loop` skill adds it by hand.

